    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im talking to you. it feels like i've spent so long just building these walls to keep the world out so i'd finally be safe... but now it's just me and the silence and it's actually worse. i feel like i'm just rotting in here. like there's no way to actually be free without just... breaking everything.",
